# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# M3 gate route (docs/architecture.md 17 M3): segment A of the Uplink
# route (test/routes/uplink.route, same ops) on hldemo1 with the game
# running: the intro multi_manager and trigger_teleport, the dome
# scripted scene, the multisource chain that opens the elevator doors
# (WAIT_MOVED startele1), a runtime item drop (CBaseEntity::Create, TOSS
# landing at z 112), and the elevator button +use whose chain fires the
# USEONLY trigger_changelevel changetohldemo2. M3 has no seams: the
# crossing (waitmap hldemo2) is M4's; test/run/m3.sh checks the
# `changelevel: hldemo2` log line the game prints when it fires.
# Syntax and semantics: docs/formats/route-bytecode.md.
# ---- A: hldemo1, first visit: intro → dome scene → elevator → hldemo2 ----
waitmap hldemo1 600
# intro: hldemo_init_mm opens tele_init_master at 26 s; the start room's
# trigger_teleport drops the player at tele_init_destination
waitnear -2048 744 36 48 60
shot start
stats hldemo1
# dome entrance trigger_once start_script_trigger → startdometalk_mm/dometalk_mm
setpos -2048 -496 70 0 270
wait 4
setpos -2000 -620 196 0 270
wait 26
shot dome-scene
# domesci_script_3 'lean' → domesci_script_4 → start_ele_unlock_mm opens the
# multisource start_ele_lock_1 (~40 s after the dome trigger)
wait 12
# trigger_once #151 (master start_ele_lock_1) → start_ele_open_mm → startele1
setpos -2327 -230 196 0 180
# runtime-item persistence: a monster-style drop (CBaseEntity::Create) above
# the dome-view spot, away from the route; it lands at z 112. hldemo1 must
# still close when hldemo3 opens (a dropped item once kept its map open: the
# next seam waited forever) and the item must be back on hldemo1-return.
drop weapon_9mmAR -2000 -620 196
waitmoved startele1 15
waitclass weapon_9mmAR -2000 -620 112 32 5
setpos -2500 -100 196 0 0
wait 1
shot elevator
# elevator button #81 (master button_lock, opened by the doors) → doors close
# → eledoordelaymm → changetohldemo2 (USEONLY, changetarget elestartmm)
+use
wait 0.3
-use
# the chain: button -> doors close -> eledoordelaymm -> changetohldemo2
wait 8
stats segment-a-end
pass
